  ('appenzell-switzerland', '01F', 'Appenzell', 'Switzerland', 'Storybook Switzerland', 'live', 'verified', 'kyoto', 'Switzerland & the Alps', '{"culture","hiking","culinary","family","romance","wellness","ski"}', '{"alpine","serene","historic"}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Painted-facade village + car-light Hauptgasse in Appenzell Innerrhoden (NE Switzerland)","Landsgemeinde open-air vote by show of hands — last Sunday in April since 1403 (26 Apr 2026)","Ebenalp cable car + Wildkirchli caves + Aescher-Wildkirchli cliff guesthouse; Seealpsee below Saentis (classic Ebenalp->Aescher->Seealpsee hike)","Alpabfahrt cattle descent mid-Aug-late Sep (dates set 1-5 days ahead) + open-air cheese market","Appenzeller cheese (secret herbal-brine recipe) + Alpenbitter; high-charm day-trip from St. Gallen/Zurich","Saentis summit 2,502 m via Schwaegalp cableway (~10 min, 6-country panorama); cable car closed for renovation 1 May-late autumn 2026","Ebenalp cableway climbs 723 m in 6 min (2026 return CHF 36 adult/CHF 15 child); Wildkirchli caves ~1,477-1,500 m — first Neanderthal proof in the Appenzell Alps (Baechler dig 1903-08); Seealpsee at 1,142 m; full Wasserauen-Ebenalp-Aescher-Seealpsee loop ~9.8 km/~4 hrs/~740 m","Appenzeller cheese documented since 1282; Sulz brine (~25 herbs) recipe kept in a safe deposit box only two people can open; Alpenbitter (1902) blends 42 herbs","Landsgemeinde open-air vote since 1378, ~3,000 voters, sword (Schwertli) as voting proof; AI was last in Switzerland to give women the vote (1991); Silvesterchlausen New Year mummers on 31 Dec + 13 Jan (recorded since 1663)","Appenzeller Bahnen narrow-gauge: St. Gallen-Appenzell ~37 min, ~every 30 min (26 direct trains/day, 11 km); St. Gallen ~1 hr from Zurich","Kronberg family mountain: Jakobsbad-Kronberg cableway (773 m/10 min, longest in Appenzellerland) to 1,683 m + bobsleigh run, zipline, Maerliwelt fairytale trail + ~7 km toboggan run (longest in eastern Switzerland)","Schaefler ridge (1,925 m, Berggasthaus Schaefler ~1h20 from Ebenalp) anchors multi-day Alpstein hut-to-hut treks; St. Gallen Abbey + Stiftsbibliothek (UNESCO 1983, ~160,000 volumes) a 37-min culture pairing","Culinary depth beyond cheese: Appenzeller Biber gingerbread + Brauerei Locher (Locher family since 1886, Quoellfrisch, ~40 beers); folk-art heritage (Bauernmalerei, Streichmusik) at Museum Appenzell + Brauchtumsmuseum Urnaesch"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 117 police / 118 fire / 144 ambulance / 1414 REGA alpine air-rescue / 145 poison","hospital":"Spital Appenzell (local); Kantonsspital St. Gallen (~25 km, trauma); Alpstein incidents via REGA air-rescue","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"Alpstein hiking: exposed Ebenalp/Aescher cliff path with steep drops + unlit cave passage (bring light), fast-changing mountain weather, sure-footed sections; Alpabfahrt = live cattle with heavy bells on the street; REGA 1414","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/switzerland","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:00Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:23:45+01:00","source_country":"switzerland","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"Summer weekends (Jul-Aug) for Alpstein hiking + folklore set-pieces (Landsgemeinde late Apr, Alpabfahrt late Aug-Sep)","shoulder":"May-Jun + Sep-Oct (fine hiking, autumn descent, thinner midweek)","green":"Nov-Mar (village + cheese + traditions; some huts/cableway closed; Aescher seasonal) — lowest rates","booking_lead":"day-trips little lead; Landsgemeinde Sun + peak Alpabfahrt weekends tighten lodging (1-3 mo); Aescher/huts book ahead for summer overnights","off_season_specials":"winter village-culture + cheese + Christmas-tradition breaks; snowshoe days","event_peaks":"Landsgemeinde (last Sun Apr — 26 Apr 2026), Alpaufzug/Alpabfahrt (up ~May, down late Aug-